id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45381::$$$message_0419_0000_0000$$$::"Heh. I knew that final obstacle would be the three founding families..."::
45382::$$$message_0419_0000_0001$$$::"Tokiomi Tohsaka. I'm surprised that the Second Owner of Fuyuki would make a personal appearance."::
45383::$$$message_0419_0000_0002$$$::"If the Einzberns have moved, then this onsen affair must be key to the Holy Grail. I'm still partly in disbelief, to be honest."::
45384::$$$message_0419_0000_0003$$$::"Saber, I commend you for your sincere desire to share a bath with me. We have a saying in Babylonia: the lady doth protest too much."::
45385::$$$message_0419_0000_0004$$$::"Strategic direction aside, may I strike down this Goldy here, Irisviel?"::
45386::$$$message_0419_0000_0005$$$::"Um... [wvl][se storage=se09015.wav] (Beep beep beep) [wait canskip=false time=600] ...Can she?"::
45387::$$$message_0419_0000_0006$$$::"Wait, Iri. We should prioritize that priest with the weird eyebrows over the Servants. ASAP. Now."::
45388::$$$message_0419_0000_0007$$$::"Woman, who is speaking to you on the telephone? Give it to me."::
45389::$$$message_0419_0000_0008$$$::"Huh? Ew, who's this creep?"::
45390::$$$message_0419_0000_0009$$$::"Swift Arrow Step!"::
45391::$$$message_0419_0000_0010$$$::"Aaaiie! Hey, give that back!"::
45392::$$$message_0419_0000_0011$$$::"Hello!? You must be Kiritsugu Emiya! I know you're there!"::
45393::$$$message_0419_0000_0012$$$::"The number you have dialed is no longer in service."::
45394::$$$message_0419_0000_0013$$$::"Mngh...[wvl canskip=false time=300][hffgchg2 chara=言峰4th face=怒2 pos=left time=400 twno=2][hfangry layer=0] Very well. Then I will beat your location out of these women!"::
45395::$$$message_0419_0000_0014$$$::"Um, can I go home yet?"::

